{"seq":3,"slug":"worker-when-to-use","title":"选型与边界：什么时候才真该上 Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-when-to-use","wordCount":1527,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"选型与边界-什么时候才真该上-worker\">选型与边界：什么时候才真该上 Worker</h1><p>「页面卡了，加个 Worker 吧」——这个条件反射坑过很多人。Worker 不是免费的：它有创建开销、有数据过桥成本、有调试复杂度、还会让代码结构变重。很多卡顿用 Worker 是杀鸡用牛刀，甚至根本治不了（比如 DOM 太多导致的布局卡顿）。这一篇不教新东西，而是把前面所有章节的知识收束成一套决策框架，帮你回答最该先想清的问题：这个卡顿，到底该不该卸载、卸到哪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>判断要不要上 Worker，先把卡顿归类。卡顿大体分两种：<strong>计算密集型</strong>（一段 JS 长时间占住主线程做纯计算）和 <strong>DOM/布局密集型</strong>（操作或渲染大量 DOM 节点导致样式布局绘制变慢）。Worker 只能治前者——它搬不走 DOM 操作，因为 Worker 里压根没有 DOM（见 <a href=\"../foundations/worker-model\">隔离与通信模型</a>）。把 DOM 卡顿丢给 Worker 是南辕北辙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[页面卡顿] --&gt; B{卡在哪?}&#10;  B --&gt;|纯计算占住主线程| C{计算量 vs 过桥开销}&#10;  B --&gt;|DOM/布局/渲染| D[Worker 救不了&lt;br/&gt;用虚拟化/批量/合成]&#10;  C --&gt;|计算 &gt;&gt; 过桥| E{需要并行?}&#10;  C --&gt;|计算 ~ 过桥| F[scheduler.yield 切片&lt;br/&gt;留在主线程]&#10;  E --&gt;|是, 可分割| G[Worker 池 + 分片]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| H[单个 Worker]\">flowchart TD\n  A[页面卡顿] --&gt; B{卡在哪?}\n  B --&gt;|纯计算占住主线程| C{计算量 vs 过桥开销}\n  B --&gt;|DOM/布局/渲染| D[Worker 救不了&lt;br/&gt;用虚拟化/批量/合成]\n  C --&gt;|计算 &gt;&gt; 过桥| E{需要并行?}\n  C --&gt;|计算 ~ 过桥| F[scheduler.yield 切片&lt;br/&gt;留在主线程]\n  E --&gt;|是, 可分割| G[Worker 池 + 分片]\n  E --&gt;|否| H[单个 Worker]</pre><p>第一道闸是「计算还是 DOM」，第二道闸是「计算量是否远大于数据过桥开销」，第三道闸才是「单 Worker 还是并行池」。三道闸全过，Worker 才是对的答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阈值判断-计算量要盖过过桥成本\">阈值判断：计算量要盖过过桥成本</h2><p>Worker 的收益不是无条件的。把一段计算挪进 Worker，你省下了主线程被占的时间，但付出了数据过桥（序列化/传输/反序列化）的成本。只有当计算耗时显著大于过桥开销时才划算。设计算耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、双向数据过桥耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，净收益的粗略条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c &gt; T_m + T_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 Worker 创建/调度的固定成本（用 <a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> 复用可摊薄它）。如果传一个大对象要 30ms、计算只要 10ms，那卸载反而更慢——这时该做的是用 <a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压下去，或干脆不卸载。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>计算量</th>\n<th>数据量</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大文件解析/加解密</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>中（可转移）</td>\n<td>上 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像/视频逐像素处理</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>大（转移/SAB）</td>\n<td>Worker 池 + 分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性大数组排序</td>\n<td>中大</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>单 Worker 或评估 yield</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小数据频繁计算</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>小但频繁</td>\n<td>主线程 + 切片，别卸载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渲染上万 DOM 节点</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>虚拟化，非 Worker</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"替代方案-很多时候-yield-就够了\">替代方案：很多时候 yield 就够了</h2><p>不是所有「主线程被占」都得开线程。如果计算可以被切成小块、且不要求并行，2026 年更轻的解法是用调度 API 把长任务切片，让出主线程给交互：<code>scheduler.yield()</code>（在长任务中途交还控制权、随后续上）和 <code>scheduler.postTask()</code>（带优先级的任务调度）已在主流浏览器可用，配合 <code>isInputPending()</code> 还能在有用户输入待处理时主动让路。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"async function processInChunks(items) {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; items.length; i++) {&#10;    doOne(items[i]);&#10;    if (i % 100 === 0) await scheduler.yield(); // 让出主线程，响应交互&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function processInChunks(items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for (let i = 0; i &#x3C; items.length; i++) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    doOne(items[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (i % 100 === 0) await scheduler.yield(); // 让出主线程，响应交互</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>切片 vs Worker 的取舍：切片留在主线程，没有数据过桥成本、没有隔离限制（能碰 DOM）、代码简单，但它不真正并行——总计算时间不变，只是不再一次性堵死。Worker 真正利用多核、彻底不占主线程，但有过桥与复杂度成本。经验法则：<strong>总计算量适中、且可被 DOM 操作穿插的任务用切片；计算量巨大、纯数据、值得动用多核的任务用 Worker。</strong> 任务切片与让出主线程的细节属于 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">Web 性能与 Vitals(33) · 主线程 JS</a> 的范围，这里只把它放进决策树作 Worker 的对照项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与相邻技术的边界\">与相邻技术的边界</h2><p>选型还要分清 Worker 和几个常被混淆的相邻方案的分工：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>vs WebAssembly</strong>：二者正交且常配合。Wasm 解决「让计算本身更快」，Worker 解决「让计算不阻塞 UI」。一段慢算法用 Wasm 提速、再放进 Worker 不卡 UI，是经典组合。但若计算量本就不大，单独上 Wasm 或单独上 Worker 都可能够用。详见 <a href=\"../../webassembly/\">WebAssembly(10)</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>vs 虚拟化</strong>：列表/表格渲染太多 DOM 导致的卡顿，根源是布局成本，正解是只渲染可视区域的虚拟滚动，Worker 帮不上忙——见 <a href=\"../../frontend-virtualization-windowing/\">虚拟化与窗口化(53)</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>vs 服务端计算</strong>：有些重计算（如大规模数据聚合）放后端算、前端只取结果，比在浏览器开 Worker 更合理，取决于数据是否已在前端、隐私与延迟要求。</li>\n<li><strong>vs Service Worker</strong>：要的是离线/缓存而非计算卸载时，用的是 Service Worker，完全不同的东西（见 <a href=\"../foundations/worker-types\">Worker 类型对比</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一份可执行的选型清单\">一份可执行的选型清单</h2><p>按顺序自问，第一个「否」就停下换方案：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>卡顿是纯计算导致的吗？（不是 → 虚拟化/合成/批量 DOM，不用 Worker）</li>\n<li>计算量明显盖过数据过桥成本吗？（不是 → 先用转移压成本，或别卸载）</li>\n<li>任务难以用 <code>scheduler.yield()</code> 切片解决吗？（能切且不需并行 → 优先切片，更简单）</li>\n<li>值得为它承担调试与维护复杂度吗？（偶发小任务 → 未必值得）</li>\n<li>任务可分割、且想吃满多核吗？（是 → <a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> + <a href=\"parallel-compute\">并行计算与分片</a>；否 → 单 Worker）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>走完这五问，你不仅知道要不要用 Worker，还知道用哪种形态。这套判断回看的正是前三章——隔离决定了什么能卸载、通信决定了过桥成本、模式决定了怎么组织。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>先给卡顿归类：计算密集型 Worker 能治，DOM/布局密集型 Worker 治不了，得用虚拟化等手段。</li>\n<li>Worker 有过桥与复杂度成本，只有当计算耗时明显盖过数据过桥开销（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c &gt; T_m + T_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）才划算。</li>\n<li>很多场景 <code>scheduler.yield()</code>/<code>postTask()</code> 切片就够：留在主线程、能碰 DOM、代码简单，代价是不真正并行。</li>\n<li>Worker 与 Wasm 正交常配合、与虚拟化/服务端计算/Service Worker 是不同分工，别张冠李戴。</li>\n<li>五问清单按序判断：纯计算？计算盖过过桥？切片解决不了？值得复杂度？可分割吃多核？——决定要不要用、用哪种。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"../foundations/main-thread-bottleneck\">主线程瓶颈</a> — 卡顿的根因分类；<a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a> — 压低过桥成本；<a href=\"../patterns/worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> 与 <a href=\"parallel-compute\">并行计算与分片</a> — 确定要用后的形态选择。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/runtime/js-main-thread\">Web 性能与 Vitals(33) · 主线程 JS</a> — yield/切片的替代路径；<a href=\"../../frontend-virtualization-windowing/\">虚拟化与窗口化(53)</a> — DOM 卡顿的正解；<a href=\"../../webassembly/\">WebAssembly(10)</a> — 与 Worker 的配合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"选型与边界：什么时候才真该上 Worker","id":"选型与边界-什么时候才真该上-worker"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值判断：计算量要盖过过桥成本","id":"阈值判断-计算量要盖过过桥成本"},{"level":2,"text":"替代方案：很多时候 yield 就够了","id":"替代方案-很多时候-yield-就够了"},{"level":2,"text":"与相邻技术的边界","id":"与相邻技术的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"一份可执行的选型清单","id":"一份可执行的选型清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"调试与可观测：跨线程的错误与埋点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-debugging"},"next":null}